      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/aimnode-technologies_job-title-nodejs-developer-location-karachi-activity-7176828931122053120-mDsE": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T01:34:32.119766+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Job Title: Node.js Developer\nLocation: Karachi\nCompany: AimNode Technologies\nJob Type: Full-time\n\nJob Description:\nWe are seeking a talented Node.js Developer to join our team. As a Node.js Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing server-side web application logic, as well as integrating user-facing elements developed by front-end developers. You should have a strong understanding of JavaScript and asynchronous programming. The ideal candidate is passionate about building scalable, high-performance web applications using Node.js and related technologies.\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Develop and maintain server-side logic using Node.js\n- Design and implement RESTful APIs for web services\n- Collaborate with front-end developers to integrate user-facing elements with server-side logic\n- Optimize application performance for maximum speed and scalability\n- Implement security and data protection measures\n- Write clean, maintainable, and testable code\n- Stay up-to-date with emerging technologies and best practices\n\nRequirements:\n- Proven experience as a Node.js Developer or similar role\n- Strong proficiency in JavaScript and asynchronous programming\n- Experience with Node.js frameworks such as Express.js or Koa.js\n- Knowledge of database technologies such as MongoDB, MySQL, or PostgreSQL\n- Familiarity with front-end technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\n- Experience with version control systems (e.g., Git)\n- Excellent problem-solving and communication skills\n- Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field (preferred)\n\nHow to Apply:\nInterested candidates should submit their resume, along with a cover letter detailing their relevant experience and why they are a good fit for the position. Please also include links to any relevant portfolios or projects. Applications can be sent to devawaisdeveloper@gmail.com with the subject line \"Node.js Developer.\"",
          "posted_at": "2024-03-22T06:35:56.173Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/hira-wahid-437ab0267_we-are-hiring-position-nodejs-developer-activity-7464631549171347458-EXue": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T01:34:32.119766+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚀 We are Hiring!!!!\n\nPosition: Node.js Developer\nExperience: Fresh – 1 Year\n\n📍 Location: DHA Phase 2 Ext, Karachi.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nDevelop and maintain backend applications using Node.js\nBuild and integrate REST APIs\nDebug and troubleshoot application issues\nCollaborate with development teams\nWork with databases and third-party integrations\n\nRequirements:\n\nBachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related field\nGood understanding of JavaScript and Node.js\nFamiliarity with Express.js and REST APIs\nBasic knowledge of MongoDB/MySQL\nUnderstanding of Git/version control is a plus\nGood problem-solving and communication skills\n\n📩 Interested candidates can share their resumes at hira.wahid@cee-solutions.com or hr@resourcelinked.tech with the position mentioned in the subject line",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-25T11:00:47.451Z"
